  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Although the camera's left-right flip button and the button for rotating 180 degrees (flip button) may appear similar at first glance, they are actually completely different effects, so rather than sharing one button as is currently the case and dividing the effects into left-right flip and 180-degree flip depending on the situation, they should be physically separated.\n\nAlthough the left-right flip button is used significantly less frequently than the 180-degree flip button, the button is shared, so we often see the sad pattern of accidentally flipping left-right when we meant to flip 180 degrees, only to realize our mistake when looking at the photo later and miss the photo opportunity.",
